# ── FLOW: PRODUCT SCHEMA UPLOAD ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^product schema upload workspace is opened$"
    When page schema upload workspace is opened

# ── SCHEMA UPLOAD FLOW ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Given "^a valid schema file with version information is prepared for confirmation$"
    When product schema upload workspace is opened
    And component schema upload uploads schema file from current scenario key 'schema.filePath'
    And component schema upload requests schema preview and waits for completion
    Then component schema upload change summary input is visible

@Then "^schema history for the confirmed version is available$"
    When page schema upload opens history table

# ── BUSINESS-READABLE FLOW ALIASES ───────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^uploaded a valid json schema file and reviewed parsed schema preview$"
    When a valid schema file with version information is prepared for confirmation
    Then component schema upload parsed info is visible

@Then "^should be able to save the product successfully$"
    When component schema upload clicks confirm save button
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and title as '${json-unit.regex}Schema v.*saved.*'
    And page schema upload captures current product identifier from edit url when available

@Then "^the product is accessible in the product list and detail page$"
    Then schema history for the confirmed version is available
    And page schema upload section is visible

@When "^overwrite is acknowledged for duplicate schema version submission$"
    When component schema upload clicks confirm save button
    Then component schema upload version exists warning is visible
    When component schema upload clicks override confirm button

@Then "^duplicate schema version is saved successfully and recorded in schema history$"
    Then page schema upload captures current product identifier from edit url when available
    And schema history records another entry for the same product version

@Given "^a product schema is uploaded and committed successfully$"
    When uploaded a valid json schema file and reviewed parsed schema preview
    Then should be able to save the product successfully

@When "^the first product field display label is updated and saved from product detail page$"
    When product field details are opened for editing
    And first product field display label is updated
    And component product fields editor clicks save changes button
    Then product field updates are confirmed as saved

# ── RE-UPLOAD WARNING FLOW ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Given "^an existing schema version is ready for overwrite re-upload$"
    When product schema upload workspace is opened
    And component schema upload uploads schema file from current scenario key 'schema.filePath'
    And component schema upload requests schema preview and waits for completion
    Then component schema upload change summary input is visible
    When component schema upload clicks confirm save button
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and title as '${json-unit.regex}Schema v.*saved.*'
    And page schema upload captures current product identifier from edit url when available
    And page schema upload section is visible
    When component schema upload uploads schema file from current scenario key 'schema.filePath'
    And component schema upload requests schema preview and waits for completion
    Then component schema upload change summary input is visible

@Then "^schema history records another entry for the same product version$"
    When page schema upload opens history table

# ── PRODUCT FIELDS EDITOR ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^product field details are opened for editing$"
    When page product edit opens product fields editor

@When "^first product field display label is updated$"
    When store e2e variable value 'E2E Updated Display Label' as 'editedDisplayLabel'
    And component product fields editor types first field display label from stored variable 'editedDisplayLabel'

@Then "^product field updates are confirmed as saved$"
    Then component product fields editor updates are confirmed as saved

@Then "^the updated display label remains after reopening product fields editor$"
    When product field details are opened for editing
    Then component product fields editor first field display label input has value from stored variable 'editedDisplayLabel'
